---
---
<!-- WHY EXERIS -->
<section class="why" id="why" data-screen-label="05 Why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="why-head reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">SECCIÓN — 05 / DISCIPLINA</div>
        <h2 style="margin-top:16px;">POR QUÉ<br/>EXERIS</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        Cuatro principios estructurales. No filosofía: protocolo.
        Cada uno es una columna sobre la que se sostiene el método —
        medido, verificable, repetible.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="why-grid">
      <!-- 01 -->
      <div class="glass why-card reveal">
        <div class="glass-sheen"></div>
        <span class="corner-mark tl"></span><span class="corner-mark tr"></span>
        <span class="corner-mark bl"></span><span class="corner-mark br"></span>
        <div class="num"><span>01 / 04</span><span class="accent">●</span></div>
        <div class="glyph" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 60 60">
            <line x1="6" y1="30" x2="54" y2="30" stroke="" />
            <line x1="6" y1="26" x2="6" y2="34" stroke="" />
            <line x1="54" y1="26" x2="54" y2="34" stroke="" />
            <line x1="30" y1="22" x2="30" y2="38" stroke="" />
            <rect x="28" y="14" width="4" height="6" fill="lime" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Precisión<br/>Milimétrica</h3>
          <p class="desc">Tolerancia medida, no estimada. Cada plano se ejecuta dentro de un margen verificable y trazable.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="metric"><span>Tolerancia</span><span class="v">± 0.1 mm</span></div>
      </div>

      <!-- 02 -->
      <div class="glass why-card reveal">
        <div class="glass-sheen"></div>
        <span class="corner-mark tl"></span><span class="corner-mark tr"></span>
        <span class="corner-mark bl"></span><span class="corner-mark br"></span>
        <div class="num"><span>02 / 04</span><span class="accent">●</span></div>
        <div class="glyph" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 60 60">
            <rect x="10" y="10" width="40" height="40" stroke="" />
            <line x1="10" y1="10" x2="50" y2="50" stroke="" />
            <line x1="50" y1="10" x2="10" y2="50" stroke="" />
            <rect x="26" y="26" width="8" height="8" fill="lime" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Tecnología<br/>de Vanguardia</h3>
          <p class="desc">Instrumental y método de generación contemporánea. La herramienta extiende la doctrina; nunca la sustituye.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="metric"><span>Sistema</span><span class="v">EXR.NX/26</span></div>
      </div>

      <!-- 03 -->
      <div class="glass why-card reveal">
        <div class="glass-sheen"></div>
        <span class="corner-mark tl"></span><span class="corner-mark tr"></span>
        <span class="corner-mark bl"></span><span class="corner-mark br"></span>
        <div class="num"><span>03 / 04</span><span class="accent">●</span></div>
        <div class="glyph" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 60 60">
            <rect x="14" y="14" width="32" height="32" stroke="" />
            <rect x="20" y="20" width="20" height="20" stroke="" />
            <rect x="26" y="26" width="8" height="8" fill="lime" />
            <line x1="6" y1="30" x2="14" y2="30" stroke="" />
            <line x1="46" y1="30" x2="54" y2="30" stroke="" />
            <line x1="30" y1="6" x2="30" y2="14" stroke="" />
            <line x1="30" y1="46" x2="30" y2="54" stroke="" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Solidez<br/>Inquebrantable</h3>
          <p class="desc">Estructura redundante. El sistema no depende de la fortuna: depende del protocolo, ejecutado sin desviación.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="metric"><span>Protocolo</span><span class="v">REDUNDANTE</span></div>
      </div>

      <!-- 04 -->
      <div class="glass why-card reveal">
        <div class="glass-sheen"></div>
        <span class="corner-mark tl"></span><span class="corner-mark tr"></span>
        <span class="corner-mark bl"></span><span class="corner-mark br"></span>
        <div class="num"><span>04 / 04</span><span class="accent">●</span></div>
        <div class="glyph" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 60 60">
            <rect x="8" y="8" width="44" height="44" stroke="" />
            <line x1="14" y1="20" x2="46" y2="20" stroke="" />
            <line x1="14" y1="30" x2="36" y2="30" stroke="" />
            <line x1="14" y1="40" x2="42" y2="40" stroke="" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Claridad<br/>Total</h3>
          <p class="desc">Transparencia documentada. El paciente conoce el plan antes de que la primera línea sea trazada.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="metric"><span>Documentación</span><span class="v">100 %</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
